/*
Time Complexity: O(Catalan(n) · n), since we generate all valid combinations and each has length O(n).

Space Complexity: O(n) auxiliary space for recursion and string building, plus O(Catalan(n) · n) for storing the output.

INTUITION
You are building the string from left to right.

You are allowed to place at most n opening brackets.

You are allowed to place at most n closing brackets.

You can always place ( as long as you still have some left.

You can place ) only if it will not make the string invalid.

A string becomes invalid only when ) exceeds ( at any point.

Tracking how many ( and ) are still allowed is enough to prevent this.

When both counts reach zero, you have a complete valid string.
